tion":{"chunkId":"guide-e2992d691aac2ee5897c1264d3f178b9b8bd443cc16b544708e983c68543afcc","documentVersion":"sha256:f4f8a628ee878c8ff6fb7f0fdc547b02ca6203c0e2a2a4e0b6a719fa1bbc0430","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":218,"text":"本说明由项目编写，资料接口字段参考所列文档。PokéAPI提供宝可梦、物种、招式和其他结构化资源。本地参考快照保留来源URL、抓取时间和摘要，缓存可以复用，但它不是官方赛事规则公告。不能根据物种存在或图鉴有数据，就判断其能参加当前排位。朱紫招式列表按接口中scarlet-violet的版本组过滤；这不能代替特定补丁、赛事或配招组合的完整合法性检查。回答当前强势阵容时需要有日期和赛制相符的使用率、赛事等证据；没有这些证据，应明确限制。","contentHash":"sha256:646ecf409f2ddb19c067dd0978eb3aecf62924e395a81f58848a83780baaa163"}},{"document":{"id":"damage-assumptions-v1","title":"如何解读伤害区间","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 秒杀 击倒 倍率 damage calc 天气 场地","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本说明由项目编写，计算引擎的接口能力参考所列仓库。伤害区间依赖攻防双方的种族、等级、实际培养配置、招式、道具、特性与场地条件。应调用伤害工具并引用返回的引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP、百分比和假设条件。只有属性倍率不能推导实际伤害。当前本地桥接只表达基础配置、单打或双打、天气和场地；未表达的强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害、太晶等不能当作已经计算。区间计算不是胜率预测，也不能证明招式组合在某赛制合法。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":4287,"checksum":"sha256:065a2df65c589c40b9e6c4dd391f2526bbef8660744f804f2d4a5704b892d328","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-ec5990770c15e5e1c9072cd94ff2093ce77edeca241d3f84e929aef60ee4dfeb","documentVersion":"sha256:f3323fc95ec350b77f0486650aff1db19b899a58fbdc4634445d6def6c3e7fd3","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":201,"text":"本说明由项目编写，计算引擎的接口能力参考所列仓库。伤害区间依赖攻防双方的种族、等级、实际培养配置、招式、道具、特性与场地条件。应调用伤害工具并引用返回的引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP、百分比和假设条件。只有属性倍率不能推导实际伤害。当前本地桥接只表达基础配置、单打或双打、天气和场地；未表达的强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害、太晶等不能当作已经计算。区间计算不是胜率预测，也不能证明招式组合在某赛制合法。","contentHash":"sha256:4147350b9f74e866fdff162eb8da3276833061e4cc05e6f7531e1027e4f58c34"}},{"document":{"id":"damage-request-checklist-v1","title":"发起伤害计算前要补齐什么","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 条件 攻击方 防守方 对手 清单 输入 问诊","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。\n\n建议逐项确认双方等级、性格、努力值、个体值、特性、道具，随后确认单打或双打以及天气和场地。若用户允许采用某些假设，应在结果旁明确列出，而不是把默认配置说成用户已经确认的事实。调用calculateBattleDamage成功后，再引用引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP和百分比；工具失败时不能拿印象中的百分比补齐。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":4058,"checksum":"sha256:bd79ff5a9c99bc64643b994b76d26c5d211729600ac90fa3b3132cf3628d94d4","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-399167a88ff633fb4719a3d3979c712579438903e4e2fdb4aec9a0b5398e460c","documentVersion":"sha256:604a2524e320f0d16e72cd129d9e2c64fcdbdc0b08e93a96f3440959b762f026","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":135,"endOffset":291,"text":"建议逐项确认双方等级、性格、努力值、个体值、特性、道具，随后确认单打或双打以及天气和场地。若用户允许采用某些假设，应在结果旁明确列出，而不是把默认配置说成用户已经确认的事实。调用calculateBattleDamage成功后，再引用引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP和百分比；工具失败时不能拿印象中的百分比补齐。","contentHash":"sha256:9e7ee999b0be221990ba2a2ef92eb06b6826808c74f7b79f2dd133f0769b045c"}},{"document":{"id":"field-settings-and-unsupported-v1","title":"天气场地与尚未接入的计算条件","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"天气 场地 单打 双打 太晶 强化 墙 异常 入场 计算 条件","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本地计算桥接会把单打或双打、天气与场地交给伤害引擎，但不会因此自动模拟完整战局。项目接收Singles或Doubles；天气与场地必须是接口允许的名称。没有提供的天气或场地会以空值回读，结果解读应保留这种状态，不能补说为某个特定天气已经生效。对不同条件做比较时，每一组都应分别调用工具，并确认其他配置一致。\n\n当前桥接没有表达能力强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害或太晶条件，结果还以满HP为假设。即使上游引擎拥有更多能力，也不能把尚未接入的输入说成项目已经计算。用户要求这些情况时，应指出接口缺失，避免给出假装精确的结果。已选择Doubles也不代表完成了整支双打队伍的协同模拟；该请求仍是指定攻防双方与招式的伤害计算。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":3347,"checksum":"sha256:5a12eb90d90013676a85eab1da25d615d9c0b7266eed5f6254f97523c5f7f99e","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-4a29fbc347cd8dcfa835b0f68ce7aecea65d974c4a413416c6c356117f54d54c","documentVersion":"sha256:7f5b7aca76946eb8ab06148cbccaa55bb16e7cf0c1aa68acf6a294ce9a0b1171","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":155,"endOffset":308,"text":"当前桥接没有表达能力强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害或太晶条件，结果还以满HP为假设。即使上游引擎拥有更多能力，也不能把尚未接入的输入说成项目已经计算。用户要求这些情况时，应指出接口缺失，避免给出假装精确的结果。已选择Doubles也不代表完成了整支双打队伍的协同模拟；该请求仍是指定攻防双方与招式的伤害计算。","contentHash":"sha256:702fc319d3dad32728e618b757444ce47544293981a3b915814d2d75a3d32115"}}]], ToolResponse[id=call_01_mWLbnIsNvTkCJrvXoRdM1633, name=searchPokemonGuides, responseData=[{"document":{"id":"damage-assumptions-v1","title":"如何解读伤害区间","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 秒杀 击倒 倍率 damage calc 天气 场地","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本说明由项目编写，计算引擎的接口能力参考所列仓库。伤害区间依赖攻防双方的种族、等级、实际培养配置、招式、道具、特性与场地条件。应调用伤害工具并引用返回的引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP、百分比和假设条件。只有属性倍率不能推导实际伤害。当前本地桥接只表达基础配置、单打或双打、天气和场地；未表达的强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害、太晶等不能当作已经计算。区间计算不是胜率预测，也不能证明招式组合在某赛制合法。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":12465,"checksum":"sha256:065a2df65c589c40b9e6c4dd391f2526bbef8660744f804f2d4a5704b892d328","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-ec5990770c15e5e1c9072cd94ff2093ce77edeca241d3f84e929aef60ee4dfeb","documentVersion":"sha256:f3323fc95ec350b77f0486650aff1db19b899a58fb